author=vagif96
description=Balanced userspace tuning for the stock kernel (GKI 6.12 / Snapdragon 8 Elite): TCP BBR + fq, light vm and I/O-accounting tweaks. Governor (walt), CPU frequencies and the I/O scheduler are left stock. Fully reversible: remove and reboot.
